          ],
          "answer_md": "The objective of the scheme is to spread awareness about horticultural technologies and departmental schemes among farmers.\n<br>\n\n"
        },
        {
          "question": "Which department implements this scheme?",
          "answer": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The Horticulture and Food Processing Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, implements this scheme."
