              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "The Horticulture and Food Processing Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, implements this scheme.\n<br>\n\n"
        },
        {
          "question": "What type of events are organized under this scheme?",
